.TH orbit-status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-status \- Show the server, sign\-in state and unsynced count
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit status\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the server, sign\-in state and unsynced count
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit status
  orbit \-\-json status
